                                                "sense_id": "70778f24-c90e-3acf-922c-b23006134e63",
                                                "text": "And why employ a bevy of eco-cleaners when the only thing that’s biodegradable in your living space is probably you, and Sparky over there in her pet Murphy bed made of tree-farmed rubberwood?"
                                            }
